# UE5 忽略列表
Binaries/*
Intermediate/*
Saved/*
# Generated virtual-texture/shader cache; previously tracked entries were removed
# from the current tree. Existing Git history is intentionally preserved.
/DerivedDataCache/
Build/*

# 忽略自动生成的 VS 文件
.vs/
*.sln
*.db
*.opendb

# 忽略日志和临时配置文件
Saved/Logs/
Saved/Config/WindowsEditor/
